{
  "about": "Which heavy checks a change runs (.github/workflows/ci-heavy.yml, scripts/ci-heavy.mjs, docs/testing.md). A changed file runs every group whose paths match it. A change to a core path runs every group, a docs path runs nothing, and a path no group lists runs nothing heavy. Commands run in server/ with its tsx on PATH. images: the local sandbox images a group needs (base, shots, or a claude, opencode or codex harness built on base). A group with shards runs as one job per shard; a shard can narrow the checks (only), add environment (env) or arguments (args), name its own images, and ask for the full git history (history), which runner-check needs to build an older runner from its commit.",
